    <briefdescription>
<para>An instantiation group contains a <computeroutput><ref refid="structllvm_1_1coverage_1_1_function_record" kindref="compound">FunctionRecord</ref></computeroutput> list, such that each record corresponds to a distinct instantiation of the same function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that it&apos;s possible for a function to have more than one instantiation (consider C++ template specializations or static inline functions). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
